ace  to grow  train and recruit  that is what the old afghanistan under  the taliban offered to al-qaeda and that  led to some of the worst terror attacks  in europe in the u.s  but in 2021 this seems slightly more  complicated the modern day taliban  appears to be more intent on controlling  its own territory rather than giving  harbour to other terrorist organizations  but my intelligence sources tell me that  already other terror groups around the  world have been emboldened by the  taliban victory over the nato troops

